<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said on Monday that it qualified for bond insurance the following three issues scheduled for competitive sale:</p>
<p>--Scottsdale Pres Author, Ariz., tax and revenues, $20.5 million.</p>
<p>--Johnson/Miami school district #229, Kan., GO school bonds, $34.21 million.</p>
<p>--South Seneca central school district, N.Y., GOs, $7.379 million.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
